$ todoer add -t First -p todo
todo/first.md

$ todoer add -t Second -p todo -d todo/first.md
todo/second.md

$ todoer claim todo/second.md
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: todo/second.md waits for todo/first.md - claim a todo that is ready, or use --force

$ todoer claim todo/first.md
claimed todo/first.md for me@example.com on main

$ todoer claim todo/first.md
todo/first.md is already claimed by you

$ git log --format=%s -1 && git status --short
todoer: claim todo/first.md

--- todo/first.md
---
title: First
status: in-progress
assignee: me@example.com
---

$ git config user.email other@example.com && todoer claim todo/first.md
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: todo/first.md is claimed by me@example.com - pick another todo, or ask me@example.com to run todoer unclaim

$ todoer claim todo/second.md --force
claimed todo/second.md for other@example.com on main

$ git config user.email me@example.com && todoer ls --mine
in-progress  todo/first.md  First  me@example.com

$ todoer unclaim todo/first.md
unclaimed todo/first.md (was me@example.com)

$ todoer unclaim todo/first.md
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: todo/first.md is not claimed - its status is todo

$ echo change >> todo/first.md && todoer claim todo/first.md
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: todo/first.md has uncommitted changes in the main checkout <tmp>/repo - commit or discard them first

$ todoer add -t Third -p todo && todoer claim todo/third.md && git status --short
todo/third.md
claimed todo/third.md for me@example.com on main

$ todoer claim ../repo/todo/first.md [cwd: feature]
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: ../repo/todo/first.md is outside the repository <tmp>/feature

$ todoer claim todo/first.md && git -C ../repo log --format=%s -1 [cwd: feature]
claimed todo/first.md for me@example.com on main
todoer: claim todo/first.md

$ todoer unclaim todo/first.md
exit code: 1
--- stderr
error: the main checkout <tmp>/repo is on other - check out main there first. todoer commits only on main

